OL,4,BEngland fined for fans' anti-Catholic  
OL,5,Bchants in Spain                        
OL,6,GEngland have been punished by Uefa     
OL,7,Gfollowing anti-Catholic chanting from  
OL,8,Gthe away fans during their Nations     
OL,9,GLeague victory in Spain.               
OL,11,FEuropean football's governing body     
OL,12,Fhave fined the Football Association    
OL,13,F#12,572 (15,000 euros) and imposed a   
OL,14,Fsuspended one-match ban for England    
OL,15,Faway supporters.                       
OL,17,FBBC Sport understands the charge of    
OL,18,F'racist and/or discriminatory          
OL,19,Fbehaviour' relates to chants that were 
OL,20,Fdeemed anti-Catholic and anti-Irish.   
